# .codeiumignore — shrink Windsurf local-indexing surface.
#
# Rationale: Windsurf's local indexer preprocesses up to a configurable file cap
# and chunks AST nodes for retrieval. Indexing large archival / generated /
# fixture directories dilutes retrieval quality and wastes index budget on
# content Cascade should never read during live work.
#
# Pattern rules follow .gitignore syntax. Paths are relative to repo root.
# Keep this file terse; add exclusions only after observing repeated noise,
# not prospectively.
#
# References:
#   - .windsurf/rules/scope-containment.md
#   - .windsurf/plans/llm-containment-hooks-rules-c7a91b.md
#   - https://windsurf.com/security (local indexing docs)

# --- Archives / tombstoned code -----------------------------------------------
archives/
**/archives/
**/_archived/
**/_archived_obsolete/
**/_deleted/
**/_oneoff/
**/_oneshot/

# --- Generated reports (humans read these; Cascade should not index them) ----
reports/
docs/reports/
**/reports/

# --- Raw data / fixtures ------------------------------------------------------
data/
**/data/sample_*/
**/data/**/*.json
**/data/**/*.csv
**/data/**/*.parquet
**/fixtures/

# --- Artifacts (build outputs, snapshots, capture logs) ----------------------
# NOTE: artifacts/adg/adg_indexed_*.sqlite is the canonical ADG snapshot.
# We DO NOT ignore it — Cascade must reach it for dependency queries.
# Everything else under artifacts/ is generated and safe to skip.
artifacts/capture/
artifacts/windsurf/
artifacts/memory/
artifacts/ledgers/
artifacts/requirements/
artifacts/**/*.jsonl
artifacts/**/*.log

# --- Python / tooling caches --------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/

# --- Virtualenvs / dependencies ----------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
node_modules/

# --- IDE / OS junk ------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo

# --- Logs / tmp ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
tmp/
.tmp/
.playwright-mcp/

# --- Lock / large JSON surfaces ----------------------------------------------
**/package-lock.json
**/yarn.lock
**/poetry.lock
classify_out.txt
eunknown_triage.json
lowconf_inspection.txt
notion_backlog.md
tests_organize_plan.txt
